gth of 3×.It disregards wire thickness, distance, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance, and measurement conditions.For a toroid, enter the AL factor from the exact core datasheet; AL and permeability may change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, aperture, and manufacturing tolerance.","truncated":false},"beam_size":4,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-refinement-candidate-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","parent_digest":"2f3c6239bdda01506b4e55f8ee0be7f5f719a09d73192931c528b9a845d1f934","raw_translation":"Het luchtkernmodel gebruikt Wheelers benadering met één laag en is een ruwe richtlijn wanneer de spoeldiameter kleiner is dan de wikkellengte van ZXQPH0000QXZ×. Het laat draaddikte, afstand, nabijgelegen metaal, frequentie, parasitaire capaciteit en meetomstandigheden buiten beschouwing. Voor een toroïde voert u de AL-factor in van het exacte kerngegevensblad; AL en permeabiliteit kunnen veranderen met frequentie, temperatuur, DC-bias, opening en productietolerantie.","record_id":"6fe9afc1ff1b32a91f1128d9bd47b0ed68b21753f4e346adb1c04e7ab2661c7f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00